1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:03,900
(Raj:)Neener neener.

2
00:00:05,071 --> 00:00:06,671
(Bernadette:)I brought sparkling cider.

3
00:00:06,672 --> 00:00:09,872
(Sheldon:)Oh... the bubbles
tickle my nose.

4
00:00:09,876 --> 00:00:12,306
(Sheldon:)I'll just open this now
so it can get

5
00:00:12,311 --> 00:00:14,911
(Sheldon:)nice and flat
before we drink it.

6
00:00:14,914 --> 00:00:16,914
(Bernadette:)So what do you want
to do tonight?

7
00:00:16,916 --> 00:00:19,146
(Sheldon:)Oh, I have quite
the evening planned.

8
00:00:19,152 --> 00:00:22,452
Our fetus-friendly
festival of fun begins

9
00:00:22,455 --> 00:00:23,755
(Sheldon:)with an in-depth look

10
00:00:23,756 --> 00:00:25,686
(Sheldon:)at the world of model trains,

11
00:00:25,691 --> 00:00:27,991
(Sheldon:)and then we'll kick things
up a notch and explore

12
00:00:27,994 --> 00:00:31,124
(Sheldon:)all the different ways
that you can make toast.

13
00:00:31,130 --> 00:00:33,100
(Bernadette:)There's more than one?

14
00:00:33,966 --> 00:00:35,936
(Sheldon:)You've heard of French toast?
Yeah.

15
00:00:35,935 --> 00:00:37,205
(Sheldon:)Cinnamon toast?
Yeah.

16
00:00:37,203 --> 00:00:38,433
(Sheldon:)Melba toast?
Yeah.

17
00:00:38,437 --> 00:00:40,667
(Sheldon:)You get where I'm going here?

18
00:00:40,673 --> 00:00:43,173
(Sheldon:)Yeah.

19
00:00:45,278 --> 00:00:48,108
(Amy:)I'm getting
an earthy note.

20
00:00:48,114 --> 00:00:50,044
(Penny:)Ah, there's
definitely some oak.

21
00:00:50,049 --> 00:00:52,319
(Raj:)Also, uh, cherries?

22
00:00:52,318 --> 00:00:54,248
(Leonard:)I smell nothing.

23
00:00:55,555 --> 00:00:57,825
(Howard:)Really? Nothing?

24
00:00:57,824 --> 00:01:01,424
(Leonard:)Just a... whole lot of Afrin.

